text = "Dear Diary,
	Father is unreasonably asking me to hide this strange safe in my room
again. Supposedly it contains something important in it that he needs
to keep the family safe. Surely if it was so important he could have
told me what was in it? I just know he approached me at 9 PM last
night with the safe in hand, and told me I must not let anybody
access it. I fear for what this could mean for him. But he is a man.
He can fight his own battles.
- Macintosh"
